00:40:46.777 --> 00:40:49.146
IN MEXICO, A SMALL ARMY OF

00:40:49.213 --> 00:40:50.014
INDIGENOUS MEXICANS,

00:40:50.080 --> 00:40:52.149
OUTNUMBERED, FORMULATED A STRONG

00:40:52.216 --> 00:40:53.284
RESISTANCE AND DEFEATED A FRENCH

00:40:53.350 --> 00:40:56.687
COLONIAL FORCE, A FORCE THAT WAS

00:40:56.754 --> 00:40:58.589
