00:40:59.757 --> 00:41:02.393
OF RESOURCES, THE MEXICAN ARMY'S

00:41:02.459 --> 00:41:04.061
DETERMINATION TO BE FREE FROM

00:41:04.128 --> 00:41:05.696
COLONIZATION CARRIED THEM TO A

00:41:05.763 --> 00:41:06.864
HISTORIC VICTORY. WE RECOGNIZE

00:41:06.931 --> 00:41:09.767
