00:41:09.834 --> 00:41:10.901
AS A SYMBOL OF OUR MEXICAN

00:41:10.968 --> 00:41:12.303
CULTURE, RESILIENCE AND

00:41:12.369 --> 00:41:13.304
CHARACTER. CINCO DE MAYO SERVES

00:41:13.370 --> 00:41:16.841
